      "| the lesson is about | reach for | it owes |",
      "|---|---|---|",
      "| a word — a dobj/dop named, a synonym argued | \`im_an.obsessive_learner.for.domain.terms\` | a \`.reason\` cluster |",
      "| an invariant — a must-hold rule litigated | \`.for.domain.invariants\` | a nature/nurture label + the counter-argument |",
      "| a glyph — a marker claimed or unregistered | \`.for.domain.glyphs\` | a catalog row |",
      "| any other concept that surprised you | this rule, as it stands | — |",
      "",
      "🟡 **capture the ARGUMENT, never merely the conclusion.** a conclusion with no argument gets re-litigated, or quietly reversed by a reader who only saw the conclusion.",
      "",
      "## the general claim it still carries",
      "",
      "when you learn, write it down — before context fades, into \`.agent/repo=.this/role=*/briefs/\`, short. do NOT wait.",
      "",
